flowchart TD
    L[Event Ledger / Artifacts] --> P[Knowledge or Skill Candidate]
    P --> V[Validation appropriate to risk]
    V -->|pass| A[ACTIVE version]
    V -->|fail| Q[Reject / Quarantine]
    A --> C[Context / Skill loading]
    A --> AU[AuditService]
    AU --> F[Audit Finding]
    F --> R[Revalidate / Revise / Supersede / Dismiss]
    R --> P
